menu "Lichen clock"
    config LICHEN_RESET_PROBE
        bool "Reset-survival probe (#330 spike)"
        default y
        depends on SPIRAM
        select SPIRAM_ALLOW_NOINIT_SEG_EXTERNAL_MEMORY
        help
            A marker in LP RAM (RTC no-init), in LP_SYSTEM_REG_LP_STORE12..14 and in PSRAM (no-init), read and logged
            at every boot with the reset reason ("resetprobe: ..."), then rewritten; "fw resetprobe arm|show".
            Shows which store can carry the clock record across which reset without a flash write. No flash writes,
            nothing on air. Remove once #326 has picked its store.
endmenu
